    "items": [
      "The werewolf howls (`HowlWerewolfSummonWolves1–3` and their Dawnguard ice-wolf and werewolf effects) have no `Association`; their wolves are spawned by script and are not counted here.",
      "`SummonFlamingThrall` and `ccFFBSSE001_WolfSpirit` use `EncWolf` 023ABE (on *Wolf*) as their template but not for `Stats`; `ccBGSSSE014_SummonBear` and `ccFFBSSE001_BearSpirit` do the same with `EncBear` 023A8A (on *Bear*). All four keep their own level (1, PC ×1, 30, PC ×1) when the wolf or bear changes.",
      "The other summons follow the placed creature through `Stats`: `DLC2SummonWerebear` from `DLC2EncWerebear` 0322B1:Dragonborn.esm (on *Werebear*), the two Karstaag ice wraiths from `EncIceWraith` 023AB3 (on *Ice Wraith*); changing those changes the summons.",
      "Every row: no other record keeps its own level."
    ]
